# =====================================================================
#  You do NOT need this file to run the bot.
# =====================================================================
#
#  Everything works with zero configuration. Prices and news come from
#  free public feeds that need no account and no key.
#
#  Copy this file to one called  .env  only if you want the optional AI
#  assistant (npm run talk, and the Ask tab in the dashboard).
#
#  Rules that do not bend:
#    - Never put a key in config.ts, in any src file, or in a chat window.
#    - .env is listed in .gitignore, so it is never uploaded anywhere.
#    - If a key ever appears in a screenshot, delete it and make a new one.

# --- Optional: the AI assistant --------------------------------------
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com  (pay-as-you-go; a typical
# question costs well under a cent). The bot prints the cost of every
# answer so you always know what you've spent.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Optional: a READ-ONLY exchange key for SHADOW trading (Phase 19) ---
# Shadow trading builds the exact order it WOULD send against the live venue
# and scores it later from real trades — it never sends anything, and there is
# no order-placing code in the tree. It needs a key that CANNOT withdraw
# (create one with withdrawals disabled; for shadow, disable trading too — a
# fully read-only key). The doctor REFUSES any key that can withdraw.
# Leave both blank to keep shadow trading off (the default).
# EXCHANGE_API_KEY=
# EXCHANGE_API_SECRET=

# Must stay false. No code reads this as true.
LIVE_TRADING=false

# --- Live execution (Phase 20) — DORMANT, and this is only ONE of many gates ---
# Real orders are behind a chain of gates that ships CLOSED: the top-level
# LIVE_TRADING_ENABLED flag in config.ts is false, config.live.enabled is false,
# a testnet track record is required, a typed confirmation is required, the guard
# must be present, the kill switch absent and the feed healthy — AND this phrase
# must be set EXACTLY. Setting it alone does nothing; every other gate still
# blocks. Leave it unset.
# MRCASH_LIVE=I_UNDERSTAND_REAL_MONEY

# --- Optional: where the app listens and keeps its files ---------------
# Normally you change webPort in config.ts. These exist for tests and for
# running two copies side by side. Leave them unset otherwise.
# MRCASH_PORT=4173
# MRCASH_DATA_DIR=./data
# MRCASH_PIN=246810
